From: nowon <nowon@noreply.pepecoin.surf>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 21:01:55 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 145/155] GreatDANE: dated erratum on the esr153 base label
 (round 5b)

Relabel the Mozilla base as pre-release esr153 snapshot 3bd39ccf6a
(the public FIREFOX_153_7_0esr_RELEASE tag 9aecd40e is 135 commits
later). Call 067014d89b our greatdane-esr153head tip.

Test messages, the publisher check, and the updater-ini fixture
README no longer say the base is "ESR 153.7.0" / "153.7.0esr". The
preprocessor.py pin 378dcc66 is the 3bd39ccf6a file and has the same
digest as the later release tag.

Computed version strings and installer/dmg filenames are left alone,
as are live-site strings for Curb Appeal (/download/, /source/).
