 .../tests/fixtures/updater-ini/README.md      |  4 ++--
 greatdane/tests/pepecoin_publisher.py         | 22 ++++++++++---------
 greatdane/tests/trademark_userfacing_check.py |  4 ++--
 3 files changed, 16 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

